sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Interface as Capture Interface<br/>(CLI/TUI/Browser/Mobile)
    participant JobStore as Job Store
    participant Worker as Background Worker
    participant Pipeline
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant Registry
    participant LocalDB as Local Storage

    Note over User,LocalDB: End-to-End: Capture to Bookmark

    User->>Interface: Capture content:<br/>"Great UX example @ui.best-practice #good"

    Interface->>Interface: Parse hints: [#good]<br/>Parse mentions: [@ui.best-practice]

    Interface->>JobStore: CREATE job {<br/>  type: 'text.short',<br/>  content: '...',<br/>  hints: ['#good'],<br/>  mentions: ['@ui.best-practice']<br/>}

    Interface-->>User: ✓ Captured

    Note over Worker: Background processing begins

    Worker->>JobStore: CLAIM job

    Worker->>Pipeline: Execute text.short pipeline
    activate Pipeline

    Pipeline->>AI: Summarize content
    AI-->>Pipeline: "Excellent signup flow pattern"

    Pipeline->>AI: Extract tags
    AI-->>Pipeline: Suggested tags:<br/>['ui.signup', 'ux.flow']

    Pipeline->>Registry: GET /taxonomy
    Registry-->>Pipeline: Tag definitions

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Normalize tags:<br/>ui.signup → ui.signup-flow

    Pipeline->>Registry: GET /weights
    Registry-->>Pipeline: Weights for tags

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Apply hint influence:<br/>#good → boost positive tags

    Pipeline->>Registry: GET /entities/ui.best-practice
    Registry-->>Pipeline: Entity definition

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Assemble bookmark:<br/>{<br/>  type: 'text',<br/>  subtype: 'text.short',<br/>  summary: '...',<br/>  tags: ['ui.signup-flow', 'ux.flow'],<br/>  mentions: ['ui.best-practice'],<br/>  content: '...',<br/>  metadata: {...}<br/>}

    deactivate Pipeline

    Pipeline-->>Worker: Final bookmark

    Worker->>LocalDB: INSERT INTO bookmarks
    Worker->>LocalDB: INSERT INTO mentions<br/>(link bookmark → entity)
    Worker->>LocalDB: UPDATE knowledge_graph

    Worker->>JobStore: UPDATE job status='completed'

    Note over User,LocalDB: Bookmark now available in all interfaces<br/>Searchable, linked to entities, graph-connected
